  MCPAllowlist: @mcp-allowlist.sdd (server-tier instance)
  HealthCommand: @../commands/sdd-health.sdd (channel probing extension)
  SecurityRules: @../agent/security-rules.sdd (credential boundaries)
  ResearchArm: @../chains/arms/research.sdd (announce-before-fetch)
  IntegrationRoutingSkill: @../skills/engineering/integration-routing.sdd

